================================================================================

This product has no required runtime dependencies. It talks to Streamline over
the broker's HTTP/GraphQL API using the Node.js built-in `fetch`.

Optional peer dependency:

OpenTelemetry API for JavaScript (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js

Development and workspace dependencies (not shipped in the published tarball)
include TypeScript, tsup, ESLint, Vitest, and — for the `@streamlinelabs/testcontainers`
workspace — testcontainers-node (MIT).

For a complete list of dependencies and their licenses, see the project's
dependency manifest (package.json) and lockfile.
